#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""NEXUS Task Manager & System Monitor
Provides real-time system monitoring, process inspection, resource utilization,
and task control for NEXUS OS.

Features:
- Live process list parsed directly from Linux /proc
- Real CPU%, Memory RSS, PID, User, Nice, and Status
- Search and filter by name/PID
- End Task / Kill functionality
- Real-time System Monitor: CPU gauge, RAM gauge, Swap, Load, Uptime
- Micro-OS Task Control Block (TCB) inspector and kernel task explanation
"""
